[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3425755314","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111878#issuecomment-3425755314","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111878","id":3425755314,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7MMOCy","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-21T10:05:25Z","updated_at":"2025-10-21T10:05:25Z","body":"Please do not request another review without having made any changes, wait until you've resolved the issue that the reviewer has raised","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3425755314/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3425780546","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111878#issuecomment-3425780546","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111878","id":3425780546,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7MMUNC","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-21T10:11:00Z","updated_at":"2025-10-21T10:11:00Z","body":"> It's not that `Variant` is inherently missing, it's that variant is called `Nil` in the variant type enum names (I think `Variant::NIL` is supposed to be GDScripts `Variant` but if someone more knowledgeable could confirm this it would be great).\r\n\r\nNo, I don't think that's quite right. `Nil` is a type whose only value is `null`. GDScript has omitted this type because it's currently rather useless (previously, in one of the older 3.x versions, we even had a documentation page for `Nil`). Perhaps `Nil` may become relevant in the future if we add support for nullable or union types, but currently, we don't need it.\r\n\r\nIt's true that `TYPE_NIL`, in combination with `PROPERTY_USAGE_NIL_IS_VARIANT`, is used to denote `Variant`. Thus, `TYPE_NIL` can potentially denote three different types: `void`, `Nil`, and `Variant`. But this doesn't mean that `TYPE_NIL` (and especially `Nil`) is equivalent to `Variant`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3425780546/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3425876758","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111878#issuecomment-3425876758","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111878","id":3425876758,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7MMrsW","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-21T10:32:03Z","updated_at":"2025-10-21T10:32:03Z","body":"I guess it's more complicated then :sweat_smile:, still Nil needs to be filtered out as well since it is currently no GDScript type.\r\n\r\nAlso the docs for `PROPERTY_USAGE_NIL_IS_VARIANT` state: \"If property has nil as default value, its type will be Variant.\" I guess this is a bit misleading then and is talking about types not default values?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3425876758/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3425929865","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111878#issuecomment-3425929865","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111878","id":3425929865,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7MM4qJ","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-21T10:50:13Z","updated_at":"2025-10-21T10:50:13Z","body":"> Also the docs for `PROPERTY_USAGE_NIL_IS_VARIANT` state: \"If property has nil as default value, its type will be Variant.\" I guess this is a bit misleading then and is talking about types not default values?\r\n\r\nThe editor interprets `TYPE_NIL` without `PROPERTY_USAGE_NIL_IS_VARIANT` differently. For return types, it will most likely be interpreted as `void`. For variables, parameters, etc., it can be interpreted as `Variant`, `Nil`, and sometimes `null`.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3425929865/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3478882480","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111878#issuecomment-3478882480","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111878","id":3478882480,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7PW4iw","user":{"login":"mu3657","id":96520710,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcDKBg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96520710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mu3657","html_url":"https://github.com/mu3657","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mu3657/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mu3657/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mu3657/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mu3657/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mu3657/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mu3657/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mu3657/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mu3657/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mu3657/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-03T04:40:50Z","updated_at":"2025-11-03T04:40:50Z","body":"I've made another commit which` fixed _find_built_in_variants()` to properly exclude NIL when exclude_nil=true.\r\nAnd added Variant directly in` _list_available_types() `as inline block.May this be a sufficient fix？\r\nps: I came across a similar issue here: #109439\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3478882480/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3479820866","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111878#issuecomment-3479820866","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111878","id":3479820866,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7PadpC","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-03T10:22:14Z","updated_at":"2025-11-03T10:22:14Z","body":"The `exclude_nil` parameter is unnecessary. Nil should always be excluded, it is never valid in any capacity. The replacement with `null` makes no sense in the context of this method.\r\n\r\nWhen you look at the usages:\r\n- it is used in `_list_available_types` here exclude nil is always `true`\r\n- it is used in `_find_identifiers ` here exlcude nil is always `false`\r\n  - but what does that do in this context? Well in this context this means that `_find_built_in_variants` will add `null` as option. \r\n  - directly after that in `_find_identifiers` keyword options are added. `null` is part `_keywords` and will overwrite the option added by `_find_built_in_variants`. We can safely skip Nil and still get `null` as option.\r\n\r\nPlease just always skip Nil and remove the parameter. Otherwise this looks like the correct approach to me.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3479820866/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3480059591","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111878#issuecomment-3480059591","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111878","id":3480059591,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7PbX7H","user":{"login":"mu3657","id":96520710,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcDKBg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96520710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mu3657","html_url":"https://github.com/mu3657","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mu3657/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mu3657/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mu3657/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mu3657/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mu3657/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mu3657/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mu3657/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mu3657/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mu3657/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-03T11:30:59Z","updated_at":"2025-11-03T11:30:59Z","body":"So now the current changes cut the whole  `exclude_nil ` from original `_find_built_in_variants（）`  and remove it from the parameter list.\r\nThe compilation seems to work fine. Would this one be sufficient？","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3480059591/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3564558776","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111878#issuecomment-3564558776","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111878","id":3564558776,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Udtm4","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-21T20:52:48Z","updated_at":"2025-11-21T20:52:48Z","body":"Thanks! Congratulations on your first merged contribution! 🎉 ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godote